{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝（Swisse Women’s Ultivite Multivitamin）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、Market Place及龍豐共4間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$201，約54%。</p>\n<h2>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝｜單瓶網店價一覽</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$168</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$168</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>HK$369</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$381</td>\n<td>HK$381</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝｜選購與包裝</h2>\n<p>買一瓶的話，龍豐列出HK$168，較表列次低標價HK$369少HK$201。龍豐網店列出的地區版本或包裝可能不同。落單前可確認是一般女性配方，並核對地區版本及實物標籤。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月19日商戶網上報價。價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源<a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn220304/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/swisse-ultivite-women-s-multivitamin-120pcs/p/642488\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/swisse-swisse-ultivite-%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%83%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD-120%E7%89%87/p/BP_293455\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/Swisse%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%9B%E8%A4%87%E5%90%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD%20120PC/i/101357796.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a></p>\n<p>Swisse香港列出維他命B1、礦物質及草本成分。維他命B1參與人體能量代謝。如對成分或服用有疑問，可先請教醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。資料來源<a href=\"https://shop.swisse.com.hk/products/swisse-womens-ultivite-multivitamin-120-tablets-new-look\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Swisse香港產品資料</a><a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/Thiamin-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NIH ODS 維他命B1資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（HK$369－HK$168）÷HK$369×100%，約54%。以上為表列同規格單瓶標價的比較，未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795026943598440_10729801966afdf00036cce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Swisse Ultivite女性多元維他命120片裝｜龍豐 HK$168，同款單瓶價差約54%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1795026943598440_10729801966afdf00036cce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較規格為每瓶120片。購買前請核對實物標籤、包裝及商戶條款。</p>\n<p>懷孕、備孕或哺乳期間可以服用嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>Swisse香港產品頁列明，懷孕、計劃懷孕及哺乳期間均不宜服用。若同時服用其他維他命補充劑，請先向合資格醫護專業人士查詢。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:44:31.905219+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":804,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:35:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T23:37:54.539460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T18:38:01.458879+00:00","content_hash":"78f339c1092aa99f8155176da2ff2f19e5955a706e2c8bc989af3ce1b94230b9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}